### Caring CoolTech API Test Suite (REST Client for VS Code / Antigravity)
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:4000/api/v1

### 1. Health Check
GET http://127.0.0.1:4000/health

### 2. Admin Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@frostpro.in",
  "password": "Demo@1234"
}

### Store Token from response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 3. Get Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Consolidated Financial Summary (Consol Dashboard)
GET {{baseUrl}}/billing/consol-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. List All Invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/billing/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Create Custom Bill (Matches Sample PDF)
POST {{baseUrl}}/billing/invoices/custom
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "SRI VNM JEWELLERS",
  "customerPhone": "8870825747",
  "customerAddress": "97-99 KAMARAJ SALAI PUDUCHERRY",
  "items": [
    {
      "description": "Hitachi Cassette ac full water service",
      "quantity": 8,
      "unitPrice": 2800
    },
    {
      "description": "Hitachi split ac full water service",
      "quantity": 3,
      "unitPrice": 1100
    }
  ],
  "discount": 0,
  "taxRate": 18.0,
  "upfrontSettlementAmount": 5000,
  "paymentMethod": "UPI",
  "referenceNumber": "UPI-CCT-1001",
  "notes": "Advance paid via UPI, balance on-hold"
}

### 7. List Expenses
GET {{baseUrl}}/billing/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Log Business Expense
POST {{baseUrl}}/billing/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "FUEL",
  "amount": 350,
  "description": "Petrol for service call in Valarampet"
}

### 9. List Inventory Stock
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Add New Inventory Item
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "FAN-CAP-35",
  "name": "35uF Dual Capacitor",
  "category": "ELECTRICAL",
  "unitPrice": 180,
  "sellingPrice": 380,
  "currentStock": 30,
  "minStockAlertLevel": 5,
  "supplierName": "Chennai AC Spares"
}

### 11. Attendance Clock-In
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/clock-in
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 11.935,
  "longitude": 79.829,
  "notes": "Morning punch-in"
}

### 12. Consolidated Timesheet Report
GET {{baseUrl}}/attendance/report
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

